SUMMARY:Jeffrey Gaines with Special Guest Meaghan Farrell
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the best of local music with two acclaimed singer-son
 gwriters who have deep roots in the midstate. Harrisburg native Jeffrey Ga
 ines\, revered worldwide for his soul-searching lyrics and powerful live p
 erformances\, brings his decades-spanning catalog to the stage. Since burs
 ting on the scene with his self-titled 1992 debut album\, the charismatic 
 singer-songwriter-guitarist has built a beloved body of recordings that’
 s won him a large and deeply devoted international fan base and earned him
  a place on the stage as a supporting act for Tom Petty & The Heartbreaker
 s\, Tracy Chapman\, and Stevie Nicks with Sheryl Crow\, among others. Hail
 ed as "the voice of a generation" by Rolling Stone\, Gaines has become one
  of the most treasured songwriters\, vocalists\, and inspirations in music
  today. Harrisburg-born Meaghan Farrell\, a singer-songwriter whose compel
 ling voice and dynamic stage presence encourage listeners to “keep it we
 ird\,” delivers a vibrant independent sound. A match made for the atrium
 ! Tickets: $25 Presented in partnership with WITF Music\, with support fro
